I'm officially an Umbraco Certified Developer, with level 2 certification (the
highest).  Hooray!  This means I'm now officially an expert on using the great
open-source ASP.NET Content Management System [Umbraco](https://web.archive.org/web/20120305102609/http://umbraco.com/).  Thanks to my employer,
[DSoft Technology](https://web.archive.org/web/20120305102609/http://www.dsoft-tech.com/), for paying for the certification.  This explains the fancy
new badge on the right side of my blog.

Short story short: if you are working with Umbraco and need help, I'm your guy. 
